Tips
{
	"You can join as a spectator up until when the first zombie is chosen.",
	"Ready to play? Feel free to test a map together before playing, and then request a match start using your configured key.",
	"The sniper is a weapon designed to deal great damage.",
	"The shotgun is a weapon designed to deal high knockback against zombies.",
	"The chaingun is a great tool to slow down zombies with.",
	"Hitting a zombie with multiple fire grenades increases the time they burn.",
	"Your footsteps are more silent if you crouch or walk slowly.",
	"Humans can sprint and run away faster than zombies.",
	"Panicking is a last resort to quickly and effectively escape zombies.",
	"Zombie acid will have more effect near the middle of the pool.",
	"Hitting all shots of Jack's gun will have devastating results.",
	"Tired of hearing the radio music? You can turn it off in the menu.",
	"You can configure your own flare color in the menu.",
	"Be sure to consolidate and configure your settings through the settings menu for the best experience.",
	"Your HUD is highly configurable! Disable parts of the hud, or change its offset and scaling to your liking.",
	"The game might punish you for leaving early as a zombie. Always play fair.",
	"The holy cross does massive damage tool when it hits the zombie",
	"The cure can be used to convert yourself back to human. As a human you can also gain complete immunity.",
	"You can configure improved blood to only appear on your self, or not at all.",
	"Don't like weather? You can turn it off in the menu.",
	"You can configure footstep settings to your liking in the menu, or turn it off altogether.",
	"You can configure tracers from yourself and others in the menu.",
	"The double shotgun does moderate damage to zombies. It's strength is its devastating knockback.",
	"You can configure or disable hud shaking in the menu.",
	"Reward orbs will not give you duplicate items. Make sure to hold on to them for later and use up existing items first.",
	"Minor orbs have a chance to give a bad reward or no reward at all.",
	"Major orbs will always give a reward, and it is never a bad reward.",
	"Flares don't work as good underwater.",
	"You can hold on medikits and kevlar armor and use them later when you need it.",
	"Some surfaces can emit particles, which could give you away if a zombie sees it.",
	"The fire crystal does a lot of burning damage to zombies as long as they are inside of it.",
	"Make sure to avoid zombie acid spit. It slows you down massively.",
	"Map voting will pick the map that has the majority of votes. Otherwise it just picks a random one.",
	"Liked the map? You can replay it by picking 'Replay map' during voting.",
	"Getting concurrent kills or infects can give you rewards.",
	"You can turn off the full server music track through the menu.",
	"Some rewards are more rare to receive and it might take a while before you are rewarded with it.",
	"You can configure the custom inventory and specify items to show, and even if the list should wrap.",
	"The game will try to pick everybody as an initial zombie at least once before picking you again.",
	"The health you receive as a zombie is heavily influenced by the health you had as a human.",
	"Initial zombies will have more health than concurrent zombies.",
	"You can quickly switch between weapons and skip reloading if you need to continue firing. Just remember it still has to be done when you switch back.",
	"As a zombie, your push ability is great for pushing away barrels. However, it also works really well on humans.",
	"There is a very small chance for the flare to have a special combination of colors, or none at all.",
	"As a zombie you can use a special teleport on some maps to get out of trouble. Uses are limited, and it might be possible a map enables it later on in the round.",
	"The final human will emit a heartbeat. Great to know you're last, but others can also hear this.",
	"Sprinting is influenced by your velocity. You can sprint for longer when you are not as fast.",
	"You can customize your radio tracks! Be sure to check out how this is done and add some new tracks to play.",
	"The scoreboard is a great place to view who's a zombie, who's a human and who has killed or infected somebody.",
	"You can use team chat to chat with other fellow humans or zombies and avoid the other team from seeing it.",
	"The minimap shows all places you can access on a map. If a place is not on the automap, you likely can't reach it.",
	"Not sure where to go? Make sure to check the minimap! Some maps even display a hint on their map.",
	"The minimap is a great way to understand where you are.",
